# LF in the repository and in the working copy, on every machine. Go tooling,
# gofmt and CI all assume it, and a checkout that silently rewrites line endings
# is how a Windows clone starts failing checks that pass everywhere else.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Compiled protobuf descriptors are binary. Left to heuristics, a line-ending
# rewrite would corrupt the file rather than fail loudly.
*.binpb binary
